@baseUrl = https://localhost:7226
@csrf = {{privateSessionCsrfToken}}

### Fetch a session-bound CSRF token before login, then refresh it after login.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/account/csrf

### Global login: supply the password privately; preserve the cookie session.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/account/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{ "email": "superadmin@example.invalid", "password": "{{privatePassword}}" }

### List all gyms with the validated SuperAdmin cookie. Safe GET needs no CSRF header.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/gyms?page=1&pageSize=20

### Select a pending administrator using only accountId/email. This does not issue an invitation.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/gyms/{{approvedGymId}}/administrators/pending?page=1&pageSize=20

### An unknown positive gym returns 404 for an authenticated SuperAdmin.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/gyms/2147483647/administrators/pending

### Invalid pagination returns 400; pageSize is bounded to 1–100.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/gyms?page=0&pageSize=101

### Provision with a stable opaque idempotency key. Returns the gym ID, not an invitation token.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/gyms/provision
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{ "key": "opaque-request-001", "gymName": "Example Gym", "email": "admin@example.invalid" }

### Reissue only an approved pending administrator target. No body is required.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/gyms/{{approvedGymId}}/administrators/{{approvedAccountId}}/invitation
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

### An unknown pending administrator target returns 404 for an authenticated SuperAdmin.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/gyms/2147483647/administrators/unknown/invitation
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}
